Credits
-------

btrfs-patrol is inspired by timepatrol by Alan Barros de Oliveira
(https://github.com/abdeoliveira/timepatrol), in particular its rollback
approach (moving the current root subvolume into the snapshots subvolume and
snapshotting the chosen snapshot in its place), snapshots protected from
pruning, and snapshot selectors.

btrfs-patrol is a new implementation in Python and contains no timepatrol code.
The timepatrol repository has no license file; its AUR package (timepatrol-git)
declares GPL-3.0-or-later.

